sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant ET as executeTool command
    participant Calc as CalcService
    participant Log as LogService
    participant RPS as ResultsPanelService
    participant RPW as Results webview
    participant Stac as StacService
    participant APV as ActivityPanelViewProvider

    Note over User,APV: Phase 1 — tool runs and a result tab appears
    User->>ET: click track-stats
    ET->>Calc: executeTool(toolId, featureIds, params)
    Calc-->>ET: ToolExecutionResult { success, features }
    ET->>Log: recordToolResult(result, expanded, storePath, itemPath)
    Log-->>ET: RecordResult { activity_id: "act-1" }
    ET->>RPS: addDatasetsForToolResult({plotKey, toolId, result, sourceFeatureIds, parameters, parentActivityId: "act-1"})
    Note over RPS: Extracts __datasets or synthesizes from statistics
    RPS-->>RPW: results:setVisibility { visible: true }
    RPS-->>RPW: results:setTabs { tabs, activeTabId }
    RPW-->>User: Results panel appears, tab w/ unsaved dot

    Note over User,APV: Phase 2 — user clicks Save (R5: host is the source of truth)
    User->>RPW: click Save
    RPW->>RPS: results:save { tabId }
    RPS->>RPS: buildCsvContent(tab.envelope.data)
    RPS->>RPS: generateCsvFilename(toolId)
    RPS->>Stac: addResultAsset(storePath, itemPath, filename, csv, text/csv, {parentActivityId: "act-1", ...})
    alt STAC registration fails
        Stac-->>RPS: Error
        RPS-->>RPW: results:setTabs { tab.state=error }
        RPW-->>User: Error banner; file is NOT on disk (FR-011)
    else STAC succeeds
        Stac-->>RPS: destPath
        RPS->>Log: recordFileSaved(storePath, itemPath, "act-1", "assets/<csv>", timestamp) (R7)
        Log-->>RPS: { activity_id: "act-2" }
        Note over Log: New FileSavedEvent<br/>was_generated_by.tool = "debrief.fileSave"<br/>used = ["act-1"]<br/>generated = ["assets/<csv>"]
        RPS->>APV: addResultFile(title, "assets/<csv>")
        APV->>APV: _sendLayersUpdate({resultsChanged: true})
        APV-->>User: Associated Files dropdown refreshes (FR-013/FR-014)
        RPS->>RPS: tab.state = { kind: "saved", filename, savedActivityId: "act-2" }
        RPS-->>RPW: results:setTabs { tabs with isSaved=true }
        RPW-->>User: Unsaved dot cleared; Save disabled (FR-012)
    end

    Note over User,APV: Phase 3 — plot close cleanup (FR-021 — partial)
    User->>RPS: plot close event
    RPS->>RPS: filter out unsaved tabs
    Note over Log: Orphan ToolRunEvent (no paired FileSavedEvent) deletion<br/>deferred pending LogService.deleteEntry API
